What raea took: the order of work (context, shaping questions, a direction someone approved, a floor read before
every edit, then evidence), modes that say what success looks like, directions dealt from a larger set, short
guides for refinement moves, and critiques ranked P0-P3 that a polish pass works through. raea's guides are
written for video, motion, 3D and games. This NOTICE is the only place in the guides that names the source.

Written new by raea (2026-10-24), following the method without copying its text:
  ROUTER.md, floor.md, rubric.md, modes/*.md (pitch, explain, story, play, tool), verbs/*.md (critique, polish,
  quieter, bolder, distill, clarify, retime, recut, regrade, remix, harden; on 2026-11-05 layout, typeset, animate,
  delight, adapt, optimize, extract, generate)

